2. Use the command:
   `/info username`
   Example: `/info IMMU_DONN`

*✨ Features:*
• Profile information
• Contact details
• Activity status
• Linked channels/groups
• Profile analysis

Use /help for detailed instructions.
        """
        
        # Create inline keyboard
        keyboard = [
            [
                InlineKeyboardButton("🔍 Search Username", switch_inline_query_current_chat=""),
                InlineKeyboardButton("📋 Example", callback_data="example")
            ],
            [
                InlineKeyboardButton("❓ Help", callback_data="help"),
                InlineKeyboardButton("📊 Stats", callback_data="stats")
